   "comparison": "POEM vs LHM + Dor",
   "key_results": "2-year success 83.0% with POEM vs 81.7% with LHM+Dor; oesophagitis 44% vs 29% at 24 months; serious adverse events 2.7% vs 7.3% [31800987]."
  },
